<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of May 16, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						May 16   WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   KANSAS CITY AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				  2,587  2,626   4,388</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				113     98	82</p>
<p>CCC					    1,277  1,277   1,303</p>
<p>TOTAL					  3,977  4,001   5,773</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				    508    723   2,082</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				194    203     847</p>
<p>CCC					    3,108  3,108   1,958</p>
<p>TOTAL					  3,805  4,034   4,887</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
